Homepage (October 2026)
- The live homepage is now the hand-written docs/index.html, not the Quarto index.qmd.
- Running a full `quarto render` would overwrite docs/index.html with the old Quarto page and may clear docs/.
- docs/ also holds pages that must stay published: cleo/ (Google OAuth app pages) and google83eeb94994ecd14f.html (Search Console ownership).
